{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>The earlobe.</b> The middle cartilage of the ear. The term תְּנוּךְ is not known to me. The interpreters call it טנ״דרום." "<b>On the thumb.</b> The big toe."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {0 "The la'az טנ״דרום corresponds to Old French tendrom, 'cartilage'."}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:06:24.616325894Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}